<title>POLAND: POLISH NBP FIXES ZLOTY FLAT VS DLR AT 2.8485.</title>
<headline>POLISH NBP FIXES ZLOTY FLAT VS DLR AT 2.8485.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-12-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>The National Bank of Poland fixed the zloty at 2.8485 against the dollar, flat from Friday and at 1.8460 against the mark, up from 1.8560, the NBP said.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
